The adaptive tracker reproduces the Public Suffix List snapshot bundled with
tld 0.13.2. The complete base list is supplied by the pinned psl 2.1.180 Rust
crate; src/scrapling/adaptive.rs carries the exact rule delta needed to restore
the frozen snapshot.

